Revision history for Perl extension Algorithm::BloomFilter.

0.03  Fri Oct 09 21:20:00 2026
  - Security fixes:
    - Deserialization bounds checking and validation of k and significant_bits.
    - Prevent returning blessed NULL pointer on deserialization failure.
    - Allocator safety: replace custom SvPV_set logic with newSVpvn/free to avoid allocator mismatch.
    - Fix uninitialized memory leak in bl_serialize (+1 length bug).
    - Integer and bit-shift overflow safety in S_which_power_of_two and bl_alloc.
    - Enforce sv_isa type check on method invocations.
    - Portable byte-shift decoding in U8TO64_LE.

0.02  Sat Jun 13 22:30:00 2015
  - Portability fixes.

0.01  Tue Jun 09 14:00:00 2015
  - Original version

